items.source:
An <a href="AggregationExpression.html" title="interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a> that renders a MongoDB Aggregation Framework expression from the AST of a
<a href="https://docs.spring.io/spring/docs/current/spring-framework-reference/core.html#expressions">SpEL
expression</a>. <br/>
<br/>
<strong>Samples:</strong> <br/>
<pre><code>
// { $and: [ { $gt: [ "$qty", 100 ] }, { $lt: [ "$qty", 250 ] } ] }
expressionOf("qty &gt; 100 &amp;&amp; qty &lt; 250");

// { $cond : { if : { $gte : [ "$a", 42 ]}, then : "answer", else : "no-answer" } }
expressionOf("cond(a &gt;= 42, 'answer', 'no-answer')");
</code>
</pre>

items.translation:
一个 <a href="AggregationExpression.html" title="interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a>，用于从 SpEL 表达式的抽象语法树（AST）渲染 MongoDB 聚合框架表达式。<br/>
<br/>
<strong>示例：</strong><br/>
<pre><code>
// { $and: [ { $gt: [ "$qty", 100 ] }, { $lt: [ "$qty", 250 ] } ] }
expressionOf("qty &gt; 100 &amp;&amp; qty &lt; 250");

// { $cond : { if : { $gte : [ "$a", 42 ]}, then : "answer", else : "no-answer" } }
expressionOf("cond(a &gt;= 42, 'answer', 'no-answer')");
</code>
</pre>
